    "done_when": "live_panel._median_from_histogram treats each bucket as cumulative (the window total is the advance of the inf bucket, not the sum of bucket advances) and linearly interpolates inside the bucket where the cumulative advance first reaches half the total, as the plan comment c-s11-ttft-median-cumulative states; tests/test_live_panel.py gains a test whose two fixture rows carry the real cumulative buckets from one recorder row pair (first row 0.4: 46, 0.6: 9386, 0.8: 22300, 1.0: 26210, 2.0: 28895, inf: 29940; second row the same plus 100 on every bucket from 0.6 upward) and asserts the median lies inside the 0.4-0.6 bucket at the interpolated value; gate: uv run --no-sync pytest -p no:cacheprovider tests/test_live_panel.py passes, pytest tests/test_agent_serve_registry.py -k agent_package_modules_parse_with_serving_python passes, uv run --no-sync ruff check imas_ambix tests exits 0; the gate log's first line names the commit it ran at and each command's exit status is recorded as EXIT=0 or the non-zero status",
